flowchart LR
  Apps[Rider and driver apps] --> Events[Trips, location, demand, supply events]
  Events --> Kafka[Kafka topics]
  Kafka --> Flink[Flink / FlinkSQL transforms]
  Kafka --> Lake[Hudi data lake]
  Flink --> Pinot[Apache Pinot real-time OLAP]
  Lake --> Spark[Spark / Presto analytics]
  Pinot --> Marketplace[Marketplace dashboards and services]
  Spark --> Michelangelo[Michelangelo ML platform]
  Michelangelo --> Decisions[ETA, matching, fraud, pricing models]
  Marketplace --> Decisions
  Decisions --> Apps
